#: 364fb9d37a0344799bf16198aea00dff
msgid ""
"We evaluated the update using open benchmark datasets, including "
"`SpaceNet 3 Roads <https://spacenet.ai/spacenet-roads-dataset/>`_, "
"supplemented with our own validation data across different urban "
"environments."
