#: d3cf25da79924cb3b0aa835bc169f50d
msgid ""
"A road network may look connected but still miss substantial portions of "
"the actual road coverage. Conversely, a model can accurately identify "
"individual road segments but fail to connect them into a usable network."
msgstr "道路网络可能看起来是连通的，却仍遗漏了相当一部分实际道路覆盖。反过来，模型也可能准确识别出各个路段，却无法将它们连接成可用的路网。"

#: ../../sessions/affectionate-great-noether/mnt/mapflow-docs-en/source/userguides/roads_model.rst:193
#: d20244f7f9c74811b27b05df97f994fc
msgid ""
"The updated Roads model makes progress on both fronts: **more accurate "
"road coverage and better-connected networks**. This is especially "
"valuable in densely built-up areas with narrow streets, irregular layouts"
" and frequent occlusions — precisely where automated road mapping remains"
" challenging."
msgstr "更新后的道路模型在两方面都有进展：**更准确的道路覆盖和连通性更好的路网**。这在街道狭窄、布局不规则且频繁遮挡的密集建成区尤为宝贵——这正是自动化道路制图仍然困难的地方。"

